{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows从VS Code扩展可疑执行。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Suspicious Execution from VS Code Extension。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows从VS Code扩展可疑执行","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows从VS Code扩展可疑执行\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://www.aikido.dev/blog/fake-clawdbot-vscode-extension-malware","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/002/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c3d4e5f6-a7b8-6c9d-0e1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.action == \"start\" and\n  process.parent.name : (\"node.exe\", \"Code.exe\") and\n  process.parent.command_line != null and\n  process.parent.command_line : (\"*vscode*extensions*\", \"*extensionHost*\") and\n  (\n    process.name : (\n      \"cmd.exe\", \"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"rundll32.exe\", \"msiexec.exe\",\n      \"curl.exe\", \"bitsadmin.exe\", \"wscript.exe\", \"cscript.exe\", \"mshta.exe\",\n      \"node.exe\"\n    ) or\n\t\n\t// recently dropped PE\n    process.Ext.relative_file_creation_time <= 500\n  ) and \n  not (process.name : \"cmd.exe\" and process.args : (\"npm.cmd config get prefix\", \"code -v\", \"chcp\")) and \n  not (process.name : \"python.exe\" and process.parent.command_line : \"*ms-python.vscode-*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1195","name":"Supply Chain Compromise","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/","subtec